 ],
 "texts": [
  {
   "text": "Fourteen bites from a mad dog",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 0.3,
   "t1": 4.324
  },
  {
   "text": "Paris \u2014 6 July 1885",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 4.774,
   "t1": 8.798
  },
  {
   "text": "Joseph Meister, nine years old",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 9.248,
   "t1": 13.272
  },
  {
   "text": "Once symptoms begin, almost no one survives",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 15.993,
   "t1": 17.815
  },
  {
   "text": "Louis Pasteur \u2014 a chemist, not a doctor",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 20.536,
   "t1": 23.266
  },
  {
   "text": "Only ever tried on dogs",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 23.716,
   "t1": 26.445
  },
  {
   "text": "One night to decide",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 26.895,
   "t1": 29.625
  },
  {
   "text": "RABIES",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 330,
   "size": 150,
   "style": "title",
   "pop": true,
   "t0": 35.728,
   "t1": 39.928
  },
  {
   "text": "4,000 YEARS OF MADNESS",
   "x": 1300,
   "y": 470,
   "size": 68,
   "style": "title",
   "color": [
    235,
    210,
    110
   ],
   "t0": 36.078,
   "t1": 39.978
  },
  {
   "text": "Shaped like a tiny bullet",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 40.478,
   "t1": 44.538
  },
  {
   "text": "The rabies virus",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 44.988,
   "t1": 49.047
  },
  {
   "text": "Lyssa, the Greek spirit of rage",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 49.498,
   "t1": 53.557
  },
  {
   "text": "Dogs cause almost every human case",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 54.007,
   "t1": 60.717
  },
  {
   "text": "It lives in the saliva",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 61.167,
   "t1": 67.876
  },
  {
   "text": "Crawling along the nerves to the brain",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 68.326,
   "t1": 72.08
  },
  {
   "text": "And all that time, you feel fine",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 72.53,
   "t1": 76.283
  },
  {
   "text": "Sometimes more than a year",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 76.733,
   "t1": 80.486
  },
  {
   "text": "From the brain to the saliva",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 80.936,
   "t1": 85.556
  },
  {
   "text": "Scientists think it began in bats",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 94.915,
   "t1": 98.685
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it jumped to dogs and foxes",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 99.135,
   "t1": 102.905
  },
  {
   "text": "At least 15,000 years together",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 107.574,
   "t1": 111.49
  },
  {
   "text": "From wild wolf to family dog",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 111.94,
   "t1": 115.856
  },
  {
   "text": "WHAT HE DOES TO YOU",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 150,
   "size": 72,
   "t0": 119.256,
   "t1": 125.305
  },
  {
   "text": "It starts like flu",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 119.256,
   "t1": 125.305
  },
  {
   "text": "A tingling at the old bite",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 125.755,
   "t1": 131.805
  },
  {
   "text": "Confusion and terror",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 132.255,
   "t1": 134.941
  },
  {
   "text": "Lashing out, unable to sleep",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 138.528,
   "t1": 141.214
  },
  {
   "text": "Hydrophobia \u2014 fear of water",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 141.664,
   "t1": 147.17
  },
  {
   "text": "Even the sight of water",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 153.575,
   "t1": 159.08
  },
  {
   "text": "Saliva full of the virus",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 159.53,
   "t1": 163.58
  },
  {
   "text": "The quieter form: slow paralysis",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 168.529,
   "t1": 173.11
  },
  {
   "text": "Death within a week or two",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 173.56,
   "t1": 178.142
  },
  {
   "text": "The Laws of Eshnunna \u2014 about 1800 BC",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 183.079,
   "t1": 187.311
  },
  {
   "text": "Two-thirds of a mina of silver",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 187.761,
   "t1": 191.994
  },
  {
   "text": "If the man dies, the owner pays",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 192.444,
   "t1": 196.676
  },
  {
   "text": "Celsus: burn the wound",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 197.126,
   "t1": 202.711
  },
  {
   "text": "A hot iron, or the mad dog's liver",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 203.161,
   "t1": 208.747
  },
  {
   "text": "\"The hair of the dog that bit you\"",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 209.197,
   "t1": 214.522
  },
  {
   "text": "Today: a hangover cure",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 214.972,
   "t1": 220.297
  },
  {
   "text": "Saint Hubert, patron saint of hunters",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 225.917,
   "t1": 229.151
  },
  {
   "text": "Saint Hubert's key",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 229.601,
   "t1": 232.834
  },
  {
   "text": "Werewolves and vampires?",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 243.431,
   "t1": 249.444
  },
  {
   "text": "Panic across Europe and America",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 254.952,
   "t1": 258.323
  },
  {
   "text": "Police hunted strays in the street",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 258.773,
   "t1": 262.144
  },
  {
   "text": "Mad dog scares filled the papers",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 262.594,
   "t1": 265.966
  },
  {
   "text": "Gone from Britain by 1902",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 266.416,
   "t1": 269.914
  },
  {
   "text": "Six months in quarantine",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 274.313,
   "t1": 277.811
  },
  {
   "text": "Louis Pasteur",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 278.261,
   "t1": 281.975
  },
  {
   "text": "Next target: rabies",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 282.425,
   "t1": 286.139
  },
  {
   "text": "Anthrax vaccine for sheep, 1881",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 286.589,
   "t1": 290.303
  },
  {
   "text": "The longer it dries, the weaker he gets",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 290.753,
   "t1": 297.45
  },
  {
   "text": "Grown in rabbits, dried in flasks",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 297.9,
   "t1": 304.597
  },
  {
   "text": "Weak first, then stronger and stronger",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 305.047,
   "t1": 309.393
  },
  {
   "text": "The evening of 6 July 1885",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 318.549,
   "t1": 321.393
  },
  {
   "text": "13 injections in 10 days",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 321.843,
   "t1": 324.687
  },
  {
   "text": "Home to Alsace, healthy",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 328.431,
   "t1": 334.335
  },
  {
   "text": "Later, caretaker of the Pasteur Institute",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 334.785,
   "t1": 340.689
  },
  {
   "text": "Jean-Baptiste Jupille, age 15",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 341.139,
   "t1": 344.774
  },
  {
   "text": "From Smolensk to Paris \u2014 1886",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 353.394,
   "t1": 358.115
  },
  {
   "text": "The Pasteur Institute \u2014 1888",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 358.565,
   "t1": 363.286
  },
  {
   "text": "Nineteen Russians bitten by a wolf",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 363.736,
   "t1": 368.457
  },
  {
   "text": "Vaccinate the dogs, save the people",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 377.572,
   "t1": 380.635
  },
  {
   "text": "Wash the wound for fifteen minutes",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 384.598,
   "t1": 390.852
  },
  {
   "text": "Treat it before symptoms start",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 391.302,
   "t1": 397.555
  },
  {
   "text": "Wisconsin \u2014 2004",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 398.005,
   "t1": 402.828
  },
  {
   "text": "Jeanna Giese, age 15",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 403.278,
   "t1": 408.102
  },
  {
   "text": "She survived",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 408.552,
   "t1": 413.375
  },
  {
   "text": "A handful of survivors",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 413.825,
   "t1": 423.592
  },
  {
   "text": "WHAT HE LEAVES BEHIND",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 150,
   "size": 72,
   "t0": 428.59,
   "t1": 434.344
  },
  {
   "text": "Most survivors have brain damage",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 428.59,
   "t1": 434.344
  },
  {
   "text": "A lucky few recover",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 434.794,
   "t1": 440.548
  },
  {
   "text": "Pasteur Institutes on five continents",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 440.998,
   "t1": 446.968
  },
  {
   "text": "The first lab-made vaccine for people",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 447.418,
   "t1": 453.389
  },
  {
   "text": "About 59,000 deaths a year",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 459.939,
   "t1": 463.399
  },
  {
   "text": "Four in ten are children",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 463.849,
   "t1": 467.309
  },
  {
   "text": "Mostly in Asia and Africa",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 467.759,
   "t1": 471.219
  },
  {
   "text": "Zero deaths by 2030",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 471.669,
   "t1": 475.66
  },
  {
   "text": "In the Americas, mostly bats",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 480.55,
   "t1": 485.642
  },
  {
   "text": "A bat bite: two tiny dots",
   "x": 960,
   "y": 985,
   "size": 50,
   "t0": 486.092,
   "t1": 491.184
  },
  {
   "text": "NEXT TIME",
